<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 02:09:09 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>长寿日 — 国际长寿峰会宣传片 • 4K</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/longevity-day-international-longevity-summit-promo-4k</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 02:09:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/longevity-day-international-longevity-summit-promo-4k</guid></item><item><title>空气中的结核菌在干燥时可能会发生突变，揭示了遏制耐药性的目标</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/airborne-tuberculosis-bacteria-may-mutate-as-they-dry-revealing-a-target-to-curb-drug-resistance</link><description>感染者释放到空气中的结核菌干燥后形成传染性颗粒，其传染性仅次于麻疹。威尔康奈尔医学研究人员发现了特定的机制，使细菌不仅能够在干燥中生存，而且能够产生与抗生素耐药性相关的突变。这表明传播不仅仅涉及细菌在人与人之间的被动移动，而且可能是病原体进化的一个时期。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/airborne-tuberculosis-bacteria-may-mutate-as-they-dry-revealing-a-target-to-curb-drug-resistance.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 01:54:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/airborne-tuberculosis-bacteria-may-mutate-as-they-dry-revealing-a-target-to-curb-drug-resistance</guid></item><item><title>XRP 分析：Ripple 正在“QDay”到来之前为量子计算机准备 XRP Ledger</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/xrp-analysis-ripple-is-preparing-xrp-ledger-for-quantum-computers-before-qday-arrives</link><description>上个月，人择模型将打破领先的后量子签名候选者所需的工作量减少了 6700 万，而比特币和以太坊则在本周发布了自己的迁移计划。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/xrp-analysis-ripple-is-preparing-xrp-ledger-for-quantum-computers-before-qday-arrives.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 01:39:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/xrp-analysis-ripple-is-preparing-xrp-ledger-for-quantum-computers-before-qday-arrives</guid></item><item><title>保护关键基础设施的新紧迫性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-new-urgency-of-protecting-critical-infrastructure</link><description>尊敬的读者： 最新的安全与技术洞察通讯涵盖了保护关键基础设施及其紧迫性的领域。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-new-urgency-of-protecting-critical-infrastructure.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 01:24:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-new-urgency-of-protecting-critical-infrastructure</guid></item><item><title>一家初创公司声称发现了一种让你的血液年轻的药物</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-startup-claims-its-found-a-drug-to-make-your-blood-young</link><description>Conboys 又回到了新闻中。他们之前所做的需要输血来过滤血液因子，并用盐水溶液和一种叫做白蛋白的蛋白质代替一部分血液。现在他们说药物组合可以起到同样的作用，并且将进行一项 100 人的研究。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-startup-claims-its-found-a-drug-to-make-your-blood-young.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 01:09:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-startup-claims-its-found-a-drug-to-make-your-blood-young</guid></item><item><title>“我还在这里：”南佛罗里达州的患者看到了新的胰腺癌药物的早期有希望的结果</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/im-still-here-south-florida-patients-see-early-promising-results-from-new-pancreatic-cancer-pill</link><description>使用新批准的治疗胰腺癌药物的南佛罗里达州患者表示，使用该药物显着延长了他们患有这种致命疾病的生存期。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/im-still-here-south-florida-patients-see-early-promising-results-from-new-pancreatic-cancer-pill2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 00:54:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/im-still-here-south-florida-patients-see-early-promising-results-from-new-pancreatic-cancer-pill</guid></item><item><title>南希·格雷斯·罗曼是谁？美国宇航局的下一个大型太空望远镜以“哈勃之母”命名</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/who-was-nancy-grace-roman-nasas-next-big-space-telescope-is-named-after-the-mother-of-hubble</link><description>你知道，我对明星很感兴趣。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/who-was-nancy-grace-roman-nasas-next-big-space-telescope-is-named-after-the-mother-of-hubble.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 00:39:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/who-was-nancy-grace-roman-nasas-next-big-space-telescope-is-named-after-the-mother-of-hubble</guid></item><item><title>标准正态分布 1 类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/standard-normal-distribution-class-1</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 00:24:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/standard-normal-distribution-class-1</guid></item><item><title>计算机科学需要计算机吗？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/does-computer-science-need-computers</link><description>该领域的理论方面不需要计算机。但如果没有它们，许多问题就不会被提出。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/does-computer-science-need-computers.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:52:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/does-computer-science-need-computers</guid></item><item><title>氨基酸代谢重新布线导致前列腺癌激素治疗耐药</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/amino-acid-metabolism-rewiring-leads-to-hormone-therapy-resistance-in-prostate-cancer</link><description>一项新的研究表明，前列腺肿瘤可以重新连接氨基酸代谢，以克服胆固醇产生的正常抑制，这一过程可能会加剧激素治疗的耐药性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/amino-acid-metabolism-rewiring-leads-to-hormone-therapy-resistance-in-prostate-cancer2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:37:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/amino-acid-metabolism-rewiring-leads-to-hormone-therapy-resistance-in-prostate-cancer</guid></item></channel></rss>